'''Kalhuiki Door Guardian'''s are two [[NPC]]s found outside the {{zone|Jungle Temple}} in the [[Jungle]] of the [[Crystal Hollows]]. When bringing a {{Item|Jungle Key}} to either Door Guardian, the door to the [[Jungle Temple]] will open, allowing access to the parkour inside, and the [[Amethyst Crystal]].

